      {
        "key": "uzh-7-27-r1:c6",
        "title": "Ahmad Yugnakiy",
        "body": "Ahmad Yugnakiyning “Hibat ul-haqoyiq” asari ilm, ma’rifat va odob masalalari bilan bog‘langan. Bu mavzuni o‘rganish asardagi barcha diniy yoki axloqiy bahoni o‘quvchi ma’qullashi kerak degani emas.",
